n=10: squares up to 100. (3,4)=25 ✓, (4,3) ✓, (6,8)=36+64=100 ✓, (8,6) ✓. Count = 4. Correct.

Max value: 250² + 250² = 125000, fits in int fine.

That's the solution. Simple and correct.

