Looking at this problem:

- `n ≤ 7`, so `nums` has at most 14 elements → bitmask DP over `2^14 = 16384` states is feasible.
- **State**: a bitmask of which elements are already used. The operation index is determined by the state (popcount(mask)/2 + 1), so no extra parameter is needed.
- **Transition**: to avoid counting the same pairing multiple times (permutations), always pick the *lowest* unset index `i` as one element of the pair, then try every other unset index `j` as its partner. Score = `opIndex * gcd(nums[i], nums[j])` plus the best score for the remaining mask.
- **Memoization**: array of size `1 << m` initialized to `-1` (valid scores are ≥ 0, so `-1` means "uncomputed").
- Precompute pairwise GCDs to avoid recomputation.

Verification with example 2 (`[3,4,6,8]`): pairing (3,6) at op 1 gives 3, then (4,8) at op 2 gives 8 → total 11, which the DP finds by fixing lowest index first and trying all partners.

Complexity: `O(2^(2n) · n)` time, `O(2^(2n))` space — trivial for n ≤ 7.

```csharp
public class Solution {
    public int MaxScore(int[] nums) {
        int m = nums.Length;
        int full = (1 << m) - 1;
        int[] memo = new int[1 << m];
        Array.Fill(memo, -1);

        int[,] gcd = new int[m, m];
        for (int i = 0; i < m; i++) {
            for (int j = i + 1; j < m; j++) {
                gcd[i, j] = Gcd(nums[i], nums[j]);
            }
        }

        return Dp(0);

        int Dp(int mask) {
            if (mask == full) return 0;
            if (memo[mask] != -1) return memo[mask];

            int ops = 0;
            for (int t = mask; t != 0; t >>= 1) ops += t & 1;
            int opIndex = ops / 2 + 1;

            int i = 0;
            while ((mask & (1 << i)) != 0) i++;

            int best = 0;
            for (int j = i + 1; j < m; j++) {
                if ((mask & (1 << j)) == 0) {
                    int score = opIndex * gcd[i, j] + Dp(mask | (1 << i) | (1 << j));
                    if (score > best) best = score;
                }
            }

            memo[mask] = best;
            return best;
        }
    }

    private static int Gcd(int a, int b) {
        while (b != 0) {
            int t = a % b;
            a = b;
            b = t;
        }
        return a;
    }
}
