- Example 1: pair (2,8) in nums2 → product 16 = 4², count 1. No pair in nums1 matches a square in nums2. Total = 1 ✓
- Example 2: 3 pairs in nums2 each product 1, matched by 2 ones in nums1 → 6; 1 pair in nums1 product 1, matched by 3 ones in nums2 → 3. Total = 9 ✓
