1. Put wordList into a HashSet for O(1) lookup.
2. If endWord is not in the set, return 0.
3. BFS from beginWord. At each level, for each word, try all possible single-letter changes (26 letters × word length positions). If the new word is in the set, it's a neighbor — add to next level and remove from set (to avoid revisiting).
4. Count levels; when we reach endWord, return the level count (number of words in sequence).

